    "text": "Skip to main content\nElena Vance\nWork\nAbout\nServices\nContact\n\nDESIGN & BRAND STRATEGY\n\nDesigner crafting brands with intention and restraint.\n\nI help ambitious brands find their voice through strategic thinking and considered design. Based in New York.\n\nView Selected Work\nSkip gallery\nSELECTED WORK\nNorthlight Studio\nMeridian Architects\nEmber & Co\nStillwater Journal\nAura Wellness\nForge Collective\nHalcyon Press\nDrift Studio\nNorthlight Studio\nMeridian Architects\nStillwater Journal\nEmber & Co\nAura Wellness\nForge Collective\nHalcyon Press\nDrift Studio\nNorthlight Studio\nMeridian Architects\nHalcyon Press\nAura Wellness\nForge Collective\nEmber & Co\nStillwater Journal\nDrift Studio\nScroll to explore\n\nSELECTED WORK\n\nProjects\nView Project\nNorthlight Studio\nBRAND IDENTITY\n2024\nView Project\nMeridian Architects\nVISUAL SYSTEM\n2024\nView Project\nEmber & Co\nBRAND REFRESH\n2023\nView Project\nStillwater Journal\nEDITORIAL DESIGN\n2023\nView All Projects\n\nABOUT\n\n\"Good design is invisible. It solves problems without drawing attention to itself.\"\n\nWith over a decade of experience working with brands across industries, I bring a strategic approach to every project. My work is rooted in the belief that the best brands are built on clarity, consistency, and restraint.\n\nLearn more about my approach\n\nSERVICES\n\nWhat I Do\nBrand Strategy\n\nPositioning and narrative frameworks that create lasting differentiation.\n\nVisual Identity\n\nDistinctive design systems built on strategic foundations.\n\nArt Direction\n\nCreative guidance that brings brand visions to life with precision.\n\nView All Services\nLet's create something meaningful.\n\nCurrently accepting new projects for Q1 2025. I'd love to hear about what you're building.\n\nGet an Estimate\nElena Vance\n\nDesigner and brand strategist crafting distinctive identities with intention and restraint.\n\nNAVIGATION\nWork\nAbout\nServices\nContact\nCONNECT\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nTwitter\n\n© 2026 Elena Vance. All rights reserved.\n\nNew York, NY\n\nEdit with",
