    "afterClick": "Skip to main content\nElena Vance\nWork\nAbout\nServices\nContact\n\nOVERVIEW\n\nNorthlight Studio\n\nA comprehensive brand identity for a boutique creative studio specializing in architectural visualization. The identity balances sophistication with approachability, using restrained typography and a warm, natural palette.\n\nTHE CHALLENGE\n\nNorthlight needed an identity that would resonate with high-end architectural firms while remaining accessible to emerging practices. The challenge was to create something timeless yet contemporary.\n\nTHE SOLUTION\n\nWe developed a typographic-led identity system anchored by custom lettering that echoes the precision of architectural draftsmanship. The warm, neutral palette brings humanity to the technical nature of their work.\n\nCLIENT\n\nNorthlight Studio\n\nINDUSTRY\n\nCreative Agency\n\nSERVICES\n\nBrand Strategy\nVisual Identity\nBrand Guidelines\n\nYEAR\n\n2024\n\nNEXT PROJECT\n\nMeridian Architects\nBack to all projects\nElena Vance\n\nDesigner and brand strategist crafting distinctive identities with intention and restraint.\n\nNAVIGATION\nWork\nAbout\nServices\nContact\nCONNECT\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nTwitter\n\n© 2026 Elena Vance. All rights reserved.\n\nNew York, NY\n\nEdit with"
